{"id":"655292","name":"红糖发糕","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/655292/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"320g"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"20g"},{"name":"红糖","amount":"80g"},{"name":"泡打粉","amount":"3g"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"4g"},{"name":"水","amount":"245g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/655292/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红糖和白糖用200克温水融化。","img":"images/655292/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取4克酵母粉加到45克温水中搅拌融化。","img":"images/655292/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"面粉中加入泡打粉混合均匀。","img":"images/655292/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"打入2个鸡蛋，加入酵母水和糖水搅拌。","img":"images/655292/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀无干粉。","img":"images/655292/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"八寸蛋糕模具底部和侧边刷一层薄油。","img":"images/655292/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入面糊，加盖进行发酵。","img":"images/655292/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"发酵至八分满时装饰上红枣，葡萄干。","img":"images/655292/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"冷水上锅，开锅蒸30分钟，关火闷5分钟。","img":"images/655292/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"趁热开始脱模。","img":"images/655292/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切块，气孔均匀，暄软香甜。","img":"images/655292/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"红糖发糕。","img":"images/655292/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}